# REQUIRES: python-api, openmm
# Unit quantities at the Python boundary (D200): OpenMM
# quantities in other units against the plain values in the public units,
# Vec3 lists and NumPy magnitudes, wrong dimensions, and values with no
# declared unit; a model of quantities compiles to the IR of the plain one.
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_units.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide CPU | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: scalar setters: 13 within {{[01]}} ulp of the plain values
# CHECK: positions: list of Vec3 within {{[01]}} ulp, NumPy within {{[01]}} ulp of the plain values
# CHECK: velocities, restraint reference, and cell within 1 ulp
# CHECK: array refusals passed
# CHECK: CPU: model of quantities compiles to the IR of the plain model in mixed and double, not of another pressure
# CHECK: versions advance on the quantity path
# CHECK: Simulation.part_seconds: 250 ms -> 0.25
# CHECK: unit quantities passed
